        "page_number": 7,
        "rating_value": 1,
        "report": null,
        "review_body": "I ordered a bunch of clothes on June 11th, and they did not ship out for over a month. I had to go into my order and click to request that it be shipped out faster, and it shipped the next day. I am so confused why it took me doing that to ship the order, I have never seen another retailer do that. The quality of the clothes that arrived were also awful, some were okay, but many were just loose fitting plastic garbage. I will be returning most of the order, and never ordering again. ",
